## Environment Variables

<!-- tabs-open -->

<!-- omit in toc -->
### Elixir

| Variable             | Deployment  | Req. | Default | Description |
| :------------------- | :---------- | :--: | :------ | :---------- |
| MIX_ENV              | LOCAL       |      | `dev`   | Elixir environment mode: `dev`, `test`, or `prod`. Determines compilation optimizations and configuration. |
| PORT                 | LOCAL, PROD |      | `<%= @internal_port %>` | Port number where the Phoenix application listens for HTTP requests. |
| PHX_HOST             | PROD        |      | `localhost` | Phoenix application's public domain/hostname. Used for URL generation and WebSocket origin validation. |
| SECRET_KEY_BASE      | PROD        | ✓    |         | Secret key for signing/encrypting cookies and tokens. Generate with `mix phx.gen.secret`. |
<%= if @ecto do %>| DATABASE_URL         | PROD        | ✓    |         | PostgreSQL connection string with credentials, host, port, and database name. |
| ECTO_IPV6            | PROD        |      | `false` | Enable IPv6 support for database connections (set to `true` or `false`). |
| POOL_SIZE            | PROD        |      | `10`    | Number of database connections in the Ecto connection pool. Adjust based on your database limits and concurrent load. |
<% end %>| DNS_CLUSTER_QUERY    | PROD        |      |         | DNS query string for cluster node discovery in distributed deployments. |
| RELEASE_DISTRIBUTION | LOCAL, PROD |      | `none`  | Erlang distribution mode: `name` for long names, `sname` for short names, or `none` to disable clustering. |
| RELEASE_NODE         | LOCAL, PROD |      |         | Unique node name for Erlang distribution. Required when `RELEASE_DISTRIBUTION` is not `none`. |
<%= if @auth0 do %>
