| AUTH0_CLIENT_ID | LOCAL, PROD | ✓    |         | Auth0 application client identifier. |
| AUTH0_AUDIENCE  | LOCAL, PROD | ✓    |         | Auth0 API identifier (Auth0 Management API by default). |
